  "villain": "Lights out, the script is shredded, the credit is deaded,\nI’m better off leaning on threads that I’ve netted.\nNo more apology, check the chronology,\nI finally broke through the static and honesty.\nYou want a monster? I’ll sit for the portrait,\nI’ll sign the receipt for the trauma I’ve bought and sold.\n\nI’m the villain in your story, hope it brings you glory!\nWatch me burn the bridge before I say I’m sorry!\nTook the crown of thorns and I turned it into gold!\nI’m folding the deck and I’m breaking the mold!\nYeah, I’m the bad guy, and it’s a better view!\nFrom the top of the tower that I built for you!\n(Built for you!)\n\nCheck the caption, check the feed, check the lies you need,\nI’m planting the garden and pulling the weed.\nNo more playing nice, I’m the spike in the ice,\nI paid for the lesson, I’m giving the advice.\nYou want a victim? Go find another screen,\nI’m the brightest color that you’ve ever seen.\n\nI’m the villain in your story, hope it brings you glory!\nWatch me burn the bridge before I say I’m sorry!\nTook the crown of thorns and I turned it into gold!\nI’m folding the deck and I’m breaking the mold!\nYeah, I’m the bad guy, and it’s a better view!\nFrom the top of the tower that I built for you!\n(Built for you!)\n\nI tried... but the mirror was cracked.\nI tried... to fill up the gaps.\nBut shadows are cheaper than being a saint,\nAnd I’m tired of trying to hide the dark paint!\n\nI’m the villain in your story, hope it brings you glory!\nWatch me burn the bridge before I say I’m sorry!\nTook the crown of thorns and I turned it into gold!\nI’m folding the deck and I’m breaking the mold!\nYeah, I’m the bad guy, and it’s a better view!\nFrom the top of the tower that I built for you!\n(Built for you!)\n\nVillain era started. Don't look back",
